968 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Bryan is a high school graduate who moved from the Philippines to Canada last year\056 He is currently working as a crew member at McDonalds\056 He just got accepted into a trades program to become an automotive mechanic\056 While he is excited for this new opportunity\054 he worries about the language barriers and how it might affect his learning\056 He also worries about how it might make him feel less confident at work\054 particularly when communicating with supervisors\054 coworkers\054 or reading manuals\056 However\054 he is motivated to succeed in Canada\054 provide for his family back in the Philippines\054 and build a stable career\056 Bryan is eager for tools that can provide extra support while in school and help him learn trade\055related English in practical\054 real\055world contexts and connect with others in similar situations\056)
